OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start across the east.
OL,6,FOtherwise rather cloudy at times
OL,7,Fthrough the day with showers breaking
OL,8,Fout, these briefly heavy in the north
OL,9,Fand west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers will continue across
OL,12,Fnorthern and western parts through the
OL,13,Fevening and night. Becoming mainly dry
OL,14,Facross the east with clear periods.
OL,15,FLight westerly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FVariable amounts of cloud
OL,18,Fwith some sunny spells and a few
OL,19,Fshowers, these mainly across the west
OL,20,Fand north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
